    <h1>17.06.2026</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>Attendees: Niels B. (chair), Victoria N., Tuomo K., Stein-Roger =
K., Orkun D., Davy Van D., Dan, Jean-Philippe P., Havard, Mike James K., Ri=
chard W., Stian K.</p>
<p>Agenda</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b26dbf6f-d794-402c-8e7b-cb6f8cf42602">IBC 2026</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6b618e80-5d33-4201-96d8-f3196e182bc8">OGraf general webin=
ar (after IBC)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a1146c29-dd29-4091-be67-5a86975dfe53">OGraf spec and API:=
 deep dive (Autumn)</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p>IBC 2026:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9746410c-1f61-4537-aa54-12b2c4a636fa">Demo pod at the EBU=
 booth.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"5df86430-6872-433f-989f-19da44aef52a">CBC: workflows star=
ting from After effect to linear and non linear distribution + delivery of =
an OGraf sanitized version</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"ecc7085c-6fde-491e-80ed-c331e780305e">Adobe: StreamShaper=
s plugin in AfterEffects to produce a graphic with a simple design but nice=
 and responsive</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0795ad81-54f2-4c7b-a13b-4561c9f717d1">Streamshapers will =
provide the template with OGraf logo and other materials</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7054c7e7-7eee-42d7-b722-d7be943ee22e">Everviz: to provide=
 animated maps</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d554a945-79a7-4e76-803f-d47a52936ce4">TV2: Blackmagic Res=
olve for non linear workflows</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6366c517-5f3d-49c5-9a71-ed7039e061a8">SPX: workflows on t=
ouch screen and Unreal Engine</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"14fb1b91-5a61-4b4b-99e9-99b55203c176">API demo: Niels/Pao=
la to check with Johan</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7890f953-a217-4026-b9f6-76ebffb18e49">NetonLive: looking =
for a server API implementation to deploy the client; checking&nbsp; the re=
ference implementation on github</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e26b4733-de67-47a8-8a48-5aae24c5ddad">CBC sharing a coupl=
e of graphics with audio.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f6cad671-2940-4e28-9278-5d0dbd89ae26">Actions:</li>
 <ul>
  <li data-uuid=3D"83da2b01-5204-4094-930b-99c5f2f0d328">Niels to share an =
excel with the shifts at IBC</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"0e5ff851-4248-4ace-a7df-db0c045c708d">Paola to check the=
 availability of a 32=E2=80=9D touch screen</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"c56ca4e6-35b3-4f46-bc6c-c8a1a1dbe856">Niels to check if =
he can get a Mosart license</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"e4233c82-594e-441d-ba97-880956590635">Coordinate action =
with StreamShapers to send an email to Blackmagic</li>
 </ul>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p>OGraf general webinar (post IBC) =E2=80=93 practical/hands-on</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"93aef41a-90b0-42ee-bdf6-37e7bce0f61c">Goal: presentation =
of the final result and how to get there</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b9b4fd8c-4901-49c0-82bb-ea01c578d82a">CBC to check intern=
ally (approval to present the CBC workflow during the webinar)</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p>OGraf webinar - technical deep dive into OGraf(Autumn)</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9b6cbcc2-da9a-4f42-b884-42559031ad86">All: please inform =
Niels and Paola if you are interested in being one of the speakers</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1a74a64e-71fb-4876-b766-36fb61a10640">SPX &amp; Adobe: ch=
ecking for agentic workflows OGraf related</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d15fc2e2-111b-41fb-9d75-24d319f88b2a">SPX: check if the g=
raphics team is available to present the work done so far on OGraf</li>
</ul>
